   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The IOM team construct new dykes in Bentiu Jedit, Bentiu town in Rubkona County. The construction work is funded by the Central Emergency Response Fund.</rdf:li>
